                        "glosses": [
                            "Being a member of a human racial classification composed of several peoples inhabiting Europe, North Africa, West Asia, and parts of East Africa, South Asia and Central Asia – as well as their descendants in other world regions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
